Subject: [PATCH] webrtcbin: notify clients when the negotiated MID changes

WPE uses notify::mid to populate the MID extension of outgoing RTP. Without
this notification, an SFU cannot associate packets with a negotiated track.
Backport the notification from GStreamer 1.26.0:
https://github.com/GStreamer/gstreamer/blob/1.26.0/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/ext/webrtc/gstwebrtcbin.c

--- a/ext/webrtc/gstwebrtcbin.c
+++ b/ext/webrtc/gstwebrtcbin.c
@@ -5740,8 +5740,9 @@

     if (g_strcmp0 (attr->key, "mid") == 0) {
       g_free (rtp_trans->mid);
       rtp_trans->mid = g_strdup (attr->value);
+      g_object_notify (G_OBJECT (rtp_trans), "mid");
     }
   }

   {
